;custom, dialogue and checks for marriage-related content
@M_KOJO_SUCCESS_CUSTOM_COM_K62_11
IF TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4 ;yandere mode always succeeds
    TFLAG:192 = 1
ELSE
    TFLAG:192 = 0
ENDIF

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_CUSTOM_COM_K62_11
IF TFLAG:193 == 0
    ;despite already calling the player her husband, she is still somewhat uncertain about formally marrying the player due to her immortality
    PRINTFORML 「Eh? Ah... Um...」
    PRINTFORMDL As you hold the ring up to Kaguya, she reacts in a distraught manner, uncertain how to respond.
    PRINTFORMDW She calms down a little while, as she gives her response while looking at the ground.
    PRINTFORML 「I'm sorry, my hus- %CALLNAME:MASTER%. I'm not ready for this yet.」
    PRINTFORMDW As you look at her, you see a sad look in Kaguya's eyes. Perhaps she fears getting even more attached to you, knowing what awaits her in the end.
ELSE
    IF TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4
        PRINTFORML 「Hm? A ring?」
        PRINTFORMW 「Is this really necessary, my husband? After all, we are already connected by a bond that is far more lasting than this.」
        PRINTFORML 「Well, truthfully, Kaguya also wishes to show everyone how much she loves her dear husband.」
        PRINTFORML 「Yes. I'll gladly accept it.」
        PRINTFORMDW With that, Kaguya sticks out her hand and you gently put the ring around her finger.
        PRINTFORML 「Fufu. Even though this ring will decay long before our love, it still makes me happy to receive it.」
        PRINTFORML 「Let us get to planning the wedding right away. Let everyone know that Kaguya belongs to her dear husband.」
        PRINTFORMDW With an elated smile on her face, Kaguya embraces you, and a warmth unlike any you knew before fills your chest.
    ELSE
        PRINTFORML 「Ah.」
        PRINTFORMDL After a moment's hesitation, Kaguya eagerly accepts your proposal.
        PRINTFORML 「Yes, of course I will, my husband.」
        PRINTFORMDW Kaguya shows you a precious smile as you gingerly put the ring on her finger.
        PRINTFORML 「Fufu. Thank you, my husband. It feels even nicer to say that now.」
        PRINTFORML 「Kaguya cannot wait to show this ring to Eirin and the others. They'll be so surprised.」
        PRINTFORMDW You continue the date with your now-fiancée, filled with a new kind of happiness.
    ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

@M_KOJO_EVENT_K62_WEDDING_PREPARATIONS(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
SELECTCASE ARGS
    CASE "TYPE"
        IF VARS_OR_DEFAULT("WEDDING_TYPE") != "" ;type already chosen
        ELSE
            PRINTFORML 「My husband, if it's alright, could you allow Kaguya to take care of this?」
            PRINTFORML 「It would be most wonderful to hold our wedding at Eientei and allow everyone to witness Kaguya's happiness.」
        ENDIF
    CASE "SIZE"
        PRINTFORML 「Ah, we should make sure there's enough room for everyone.」
        PRINTFORML 「We'll have to invite Eirin, of course, and Reisen, and Tewi, and we mustn't forget about Reimu and Marisa, either.」
        PRINTFORML 「Ah, we need to make sure we can fit in all the Inaba, too, as well as-」
        PRINTFORMDL As Kaguya keeps listing more and more people she wants to be at the wedding, you urge her to restrain herself a little, and consider the budget.
        PRINTFORMDL However, as soon as you see a hint of sadness on her beautiful face, you give in and tell her that you'll do what you can, and her smile returns.
        PRINTFORML 「Thank you, my husband. Let's make this the most wonderful day of our lives.」
    CASE "DATE"
    CASE "GUESTS"
ENDSELECT

@M_KOJO_EVENT_K62_CUSTOM_WEDDING(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
#DIM DYNAMIC GUEST_COUNT
IF EXISTVAR("WEDDING_GUESTS")
    FOR LOCAL, 0, CHARANUM
        SIF GETVAR(@"WEDDING_GUESTS:{LOCAL}")
            GUEST_COUNT++
    NEXT
ENDIF
CALL OKIGAE(MASTER, OBJNAME_TO_ID(MASTER, "GET", "衣装セット", "ウェディングスーツセット"))
CALL OKIGAE([[輝夜]], OBJNAME_TO_ID([[輝夜]], "GET", "衣装セット", "ウェディングセット"))

PRINTFORMDW As you arrive, you see a bunch of rabbits scurry about, hurriedly putting the last few preparations in order.
PRINTFORMDL When Reisen spots you, she quickly takes you to the waiting area.
CALL SPTALK, [[鈴仙]], "通常", 0, "「The princess should be ready soon. You can just wait here until the ceremony begins.」", 1
PRINTFORMDW Having said that, Reisen runs off again, as she tries to supervise the rabbits during their efforts.
PRINTFORMDL Once Reisen is out of sight, Tewi discreetly enters the room, clearly having shirked her duties.
CALL SPTALK, [[てゐ]], "笑顔", 0, "「So today's the big day, then. Our sweet little princess is finally getting married.」/「Ah, I remember the day of her arrival in the bamboo forest as if it was only yesterday.」/「Nothing but the clothes on her back, hiding from the cold in some forgotten corner until some kind rabbit offered her shelter.」", 1

IF TALENT:[[てゐ]]:恋慕
    PRINTFORMDL As Tewi continues her fibbing, she suddenly changes tone, with a somewhat wistful look on her face.
    CALL SPTALK, [[てゐ]], "通常", 0, "「It's not too late, you know?」/「You can still accept your true feelings and run away with me.」/「Come, take my hand. We'll go somewhere where none of them will ever find us and be a family together.」", 1
    PRINTFORMDW Thinking the joke has gone on long enough, you give your response by pulling Tewi's ears.
    CALL SPTALK, [[てゐ]], "怒り", 0, "「Ow ow ow. I'm kidding, I'm kidding.」", 1
    CALL SPTALK, [[てゐ]], "通常", 0, @"「Can't you take a joke, %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」/「Even I wouldn't do such a thing, you know.」/「Besides, I bet Master would turn me into a fur coat if I tried.」", 1
    PRINTFORMDW You and Tewi share a laugh together until you hear someone else approach.
ELSE
    PRINTFORMDW Tewi continues to spin her dubious tale for a while, until you hear someone else approach.
ENDIF

CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "笑顔", 0, @"「Ah, there you are, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. Right on time.」/「The ceremony will begin once the princess is ready.」", 1
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, "「Hm? Stand still, please.」", 1

IF BASE:MASTER:勃起 > 500
    PRINTFORMDL Eirin grabs you by the chin, and uses her fingers to push a pill deep into your throat, as if she was giving medication to an animal.
    PRINTFORMDW As soon as it goes down, you feel your nether regions calm down.
    CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "笑顔", 0, "「That should prevent any unwanted accidents during the ceremony.」/「Everything needs to be perfect today.」", 1
    BASE:MASTER:勃起 = 0
ELSE
    PRINTFORMDL Eirin starts straightening your collar, sleeves, and tie, fussing with it until it's all perfect.
    CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "笑顔", 0, "「There. You look splendid.」/「Nothing must spoil the princess' special day.」", 1
ENDIF
WAIT

PRINTFORMDL It isn't much later that Kaguya herself finally arrives, wearing a dress more magnificent than any you've ever seen before.
PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG("Woven from the finest Lunarian materials, adorned by the most splendid jewelry, and a hem so long that it needs to be carried by no less than twelve rabbits, its beauty is only surpassed by that of Kaguya herself.")%
PRINTFORMDW While you're momentarily distracted by the sight of her, she rushes towards you and embraces you firmly.
CALL SPTALK, [[輝夜]], "Smile", 0, "「My husband, you look wonderful.」", 1
CALL SPTALK, [[輝夜]], "笑顔", 0, "「Ah, but I suppose Kaguya shouldn't be calling you \"my husband\" just yet, right?」", 1
WAIT
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "笑顔", 0, "「We're about to start the ceremony. Are you two ready?」", 1
PRINTFORMDL Kaguya nods and the two of you follow Eirin to the stage.

PRINTFORMD As you walk alongside Kaguya, you see 
SELECTCASE VAR_OR_DEFAULT(GUEST_COUNT)
    CASE IS > CHARANUM - 10
        PRINTFORMDL virtually every notable person in Gensokyo in attendance for the social event of the year.
    CASE 50
        PRINTFORMDL a great many people in attendance.
    CASE IS >= 15
        PRINTFORMDL your closest friends on their seats.
    CASEELSE
        PRINTFORMDL the few people you invited on their seats.
ENDSELECT

IF CFLAG:[[輝夜]]:子供人数
    LOCALS =
    FOR LOCAL, 0, VARSIZE("CHILDNAME")
        SIF STRLENS(CHILDNAME:LOCAL)
            LOCALS += @"%CHILDNAME:LOCAL%、"
    NEXT
    PRINTFORMDL %BREAKENG(@"Naturally, %LIST_IN_STRING(LOCALS)% \@ CFLAG:[[輝夜]]:子供人数 > 1 ? are # is \@ seated in the front row.")%
ENDIF

;remaining seats
LOCAL = VAR_OR_DEFAULT("WEDDING_SIZE") - GUEST_COUNT
IF VAR_OR_DEFAULT("WEDDING_SIZE") <= 50
    IF LOCAL <= 0
        PRINTFORMDW There are also many of the rabbits, but as there are no seats for them, they're forced to stand behind the guests.
    ELSE
        PRINTFORMDW The remaining seats are used by the rabbits, but as there is not enough room for all of them, the remainder are forced to stand behind the guests.
    ENDIF
ELSE
    PRINTFORMDW The remaining seats are used by the rabbits, and the wedding area is barely able to fit in all of them.
ENDIF
PRINTFORMDL Kaguya has her arm firmly wrapped around yours, as if to show off her ownership of you.
IF CHARANUM - CMATCH(TALENT:恋慕, 0, 1) > 2
    PRINTFORMDW As you look around, some of their faces appear to be hiding a degree of jealousy.
ELSE
    PRINTFORMDW Her fears seem to be unwarranted, however, as all the guests seem to be happy for her.
ENDIF
PRINTFORMDL Before long, you arrive at the stage.
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, "「Welcome everyone. I'm glad all of you could make it here today.」", 1
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, "「When we first came to Gensokyo, I never could've imagined things would end up like this.」/「Had it been up to me, we would've remained hidden in the bamboo forest forever and lived a quiet life together.」/「It was only at the princess' urging that we revealed ourselves to the rest of Gensokyo.」/「But I now see that was the best decision we ever made.」", 1
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "笑顔", 0, @"「After all, she never would've been able to meet %CALLNAME:MASTER% otherwise.」", 1
WAIT
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, "「Seeing her smile so much every day...」/「It is truly a blessing beyond any other.」", 1
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, "「I'm sure we can all share in her happiness today, knowing that these two have a bright future ahead of them.」", 1
WAIT
PRINTFORMDL Eirin motions for you to come closer.
CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, @"「As the sage of the moon, I'm am honored to join the two of you in marriage today.」/「Kaguya, I trust that you will dutifully take care of %CALLNAME:MASTER% as %HIS_HER(MASTER)% wife.」/「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, I trust that you will always protect Kaguya and ensure that she won't ever become unhappy.」", 1
PRINTFORMDW ...or else I'll make you regret it, is what she's clearly hinting at.

IF TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4
    CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, @"「Now then, Kaguya, with everyone here present as a witness, do you accept %CALLNAME:MASTER% as your husband, from now until eternity?」", 1
ELSE
    CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, @"「Now then, Kaguya, with everyone here present as a witness, do you accept %CALLNAME:MASTER% as your husband, until death parts you?」", 1
ENDIF
WAIT
CALL SPTALK, [[輝夜]], "Smile", 0, "「Yes, of course!」", 1
WAIT
PRINTFORMDL Eirin smiles before turning to you.

IF TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4
    CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, @"「And you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%, with everyone here present as a witness, do you accept Kaguya as your wife/, and to love and cherish her above all else, from now until eternity?」", 1
ELSE
    CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, @"「And you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%, with everyone here present as a witness, do you accept Kaguya as your wife/, and to love and cherish her above all else, until death comes for you?」", 1
ENDIF
PRINTFORMDL [0] Yes, I do.
INPUT

CALL SPTALK, [[永琳]], "通常", 0, "「Then as the sage of the moon, I declare you to be husband and wife.」/「Congratulations.」/「You may now kiss the-」", 1
PRINTFORMDL Before Eirin can even finish her sentence, Kaguya pulls you into a deep embrace and kisses you passionately, to the cheers of the audience.
PRINTFORMDW Not content with just your lips, she forces them apart with her tongue and invades your mouth, licking every part of your mouth.
PRINTFORMDL When she finally lets go, Kaguya is panting and out of breath, her exquisite appearance now disheveled and lacking its former composure.
PRINTFORMDL Yet somehow, to you your now-wife only looks more beautiful than ever before.
PRINTFORMDW With her by your side, surely \@ TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4 ? eternity # the rest of your life \@ will only bring happiness to you.

TIME += 240
RETURN 1


@M_KOJO_EVENT_K62_WEDDING(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
SELECTCASE VARS_OR_DEFAULT("WEDDING_TYPE")
    CASE "WESTERN"
        SELECTCASE ARGS
            CASE "AISLE_WALK"
                PRINTFORMDL You see Eirin walk Kaguya down the aisle, followed by a pair of rabbits carrying the end of her wedding dress.
                PRINTFORMDW Seeing her in this magnificent dress for the first time, she looks even more beautiful than usual, and your heart skips a beat.
            CASE "I_DO"
                PRINTFORMDL Kaguya takes your hands, and firmly grips them as she gives her answer.
                CALL SPTALK, [[輝夜]], "Smile", 0, "「I do.」", 1
            CASE "KISS"
                PRINTFORMDL Kaguya takes the initiative and puts her lips against yours, embracing you in a passionate kiss.
                PRINTFORMDL She wraps her arms around you while her tongue invades your mouth, as if expressing her ownership of you to everyone present.
                PRINTFORMDL When she finally lets go, she's panting heavily, before showing you a brilliant smile.
                PRINTFORML 「Fufu, my dear husband. I love you so much.」
                PRINTFORML 「Please take care of Kaguya for all eternity.」
        ENDSELECT
        RETURN 1
ENDSELECT

